{"version":1,"content":"<p>廣東佛山一間醫院的藥房職員獲患者贈送1.9 元（人民幣，下同）汽水後，遭對方舉報「違規收禮」，相關投訴單截圖在網上流傳引起熱議。</p><p>涉事佛山復星禪誠醫院昨（13日）回應稱，該職員並無主動索取財物，事件不構成違反醫德，當事人已就網上不實傳言向警方報案。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.589036+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T09:44:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T15:18:25.721141+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416450+00:00","content_hash":"a8fec1c300892169e82313431c27237c722abbca71ff1f65ae8daf17dcf2eb03","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}